mindmap
  root((OutaStock))
    Architecture
      Frontend state: TanStack Query + React Context + component-local state
      Backend pattern: cmd -> transport -> handlers -> services -> sqlc repository
      Infra: Docker Compose + Caddy + GitHub Actions + Air + sqlc
    Infrastructure & Ops
