    Logical Connections
      web/src/main.tsx -> App -> Template -> pages/components
      hooks/* -> services/* -> services/http.ts -> backend /api
      WebSocketProvider -> query invalidation -> TanStack cache refresh
      db/queries/*.sql -> sqlc -> backend/internal/repository/*.sql.go
      handlers/* -> services/* -> repository/* -> PostgreSQL
      docker-compose*.yml -> Caddy + backend Dockerfile + web Dockerfile + db migrations
